WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.679
ScentedRealms brings fantasy scents to a roleplaying table. For its Kickstarter campaign,

00:00:04.679 --> 00:00:09.358
Umair developed the visual direction and campaign presentation. The first job was

00:00:09.358 --> 00:00:14.037
to make an unfamiliar accessory understandable.

00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:18.433
The opening composition puts the physical products in the foreground. Visitors can

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:22.430
see the ScentEngine, the packaged scents and the wider collection, while the

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:26.426
fantasy imagery establishes the setting.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:30.457
Grouping the products gives the collection a visible scale. The red frame,

00:00:30.457 --> 00:00:34.088
dark background and fantasy colour keep the presentation consistent, while the products

00:00:34.088 --> 00:00:37.720
remain the focus.

00:00:38.119 --> 00:00:41.994
For a launch like this, the page needs to explain what the

00:00:41.994 --> 00:00:45.868
accessory is, how it fits into a session and what a backer

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:49.743
receives. Umair's contribution was the campaign presentation. The product, identity and supplied

00:00:49.743 --> 00:00:53.617
imagery belong to the creator.
